    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\n  The top of the line cyberchair, giving the premier user many options. While\n  using it the operator's base MOVE becomes 5, with all regular movement options\n  remaining available.\n</p>\n<p>\n  Additionally, this cyberchair has room for 4 cyberlimb options*. Any options\n  installed always count as being paired.\n</p>\n<p>\n  Operation of the cyberchair requires either a free hand, or interface plugs.\n</p>\n<p>\n  If the operator suffers a critical injury that reduces their MOVE, the MOVE of\n  the cyberchair is instead effected.\n</p>\n<p>\n  The cyberchair cannot be targeted specifically, nor can it be disabled via EMP\n  effects.\n</p>\n<p><em>*Installing cyberlimb options currently not supported</em></p>\n"
    },
